#question(title: [A polynomial given its derivatives])[
  #set text(size: 13pt)

  + Consider the polynomial
    $display(P(x) = c_0 + c_1 x + c_2 x^2 + c_3 x^3)$.
    Find values of the coefficients that
    satisfy
     $
       P(0) = 1, quad P' (0) = 5, quad P^(' ') (0) = 3, quad P^(' ' ') (0) = - 7
     $
  + Find #emph[all] polynomials $P$ (of any
    degree) that satisfy
     $
       P(0) = 1, quad P' (0) = 5, quad P^(' ') (0) = 3, quad P^(' ' ') (0) = - 7
     $
  + Find a polynomial $P$ of smallest
    possible degree that satisfies
     $
       P(0) = A, quad P' (0) = B, quad P^(' ') (0) = C, quad P^(' ' ') (0) = D
     $
]
